    {
      "kind": "synopsis",
      "source_text": "誕生日当日。想楽は両親や兄、Legenders\nやプロデューサーから届いたお祝いの\nメッセージを読んでいた。\n雨彦やクリスから、事務所で待っている\nというメッセージをもらった想楽は……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 1
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-1:text",
        "step_id": 1,
        "step_index": 0,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "よし、誕生日会の準備は\nこんなところか。\nあとは北村を迎えに行くだけだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 4
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "少し早いですが、\n想楽の大学へ出発しませんか？\n初めて通る道もありますし。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "046chr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "046chr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "かまわないぜ。\n早く着く分には問題ないだろ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "では、車に向かいましょう。\n想楽は私たちの迎えに、\n驚いてくれるでしょうか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "046chr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "046chr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "間違いなく、\n予想してないだろうな。\n反応を見るのが楽しみだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "北村、誕生日の祝いに星占いを\nしてやろうか？　占ってほしい\nことがあれば、だけどな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "占ってほしいことかー。\n何かあるかなー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "045sor"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "045sor",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "せっかくだし、\nLegendersのこれからの1年を\n占ってもらいたいかもー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "045sor"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "045sor",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なるほど、そうきたか。\nもちろん、かまわないぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "占いの結果はあとで連絡する。\nどんな結果が出るか、\n占うのが楽しみになってきたよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "044ame",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そういえば、車のシートに\nプレゼントが置いてあったのは\nクリスさんのアイデア？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "045sor"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "045sor",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 16
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ、そうです。連続で想楽を\n驚かせることができるのでは、\nと考えました。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "046chr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "046chr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 17
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:step-17:text",
